### JSON / cache MISS then HIT (repeat within 5 seconds)
GET http://localhost:8080/employees
Accept: application/json

### XML is a separate cache entry
GET http://localhost:8080/employees
Accept: application/xml

### Round robin: repeat and observe X-Warehouse
GET http://localhost:8080/employees
Cache-Control: no-cache

### Pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/employees?offset=1&limit=2

### Source node publishes an employee; invalidates cache
PUT http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=4&name=Alexandra

### Client proposes a modification
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=4&name=Alexandra%20Manea

### Source node polls proposed changes; retains highest sequence as cursor
GET http://localhost:8080/updates/employees?after=0

### Source confirms modification by publishing it
PUT http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=4&name=Alexandra%20Manea

### Read confirmed data
GET http://localhost:8080/employees?id=4
